  "description": "Hey people!!!\n\nI understand if you looking for a glorious guild with fancy furniture and all the gimmick you can find but this is not one of them this one is feel with hope and a good old fashioned kick ass time with buddy with goal and friendship so if it not you cup of ale then look elsewhere otherwise have a great time and maybe communicate to each of us once in a while we&#039;re a team and we don&#039;t have to be comfortable with speaking every day but can you try to open up enough to show your here.\n\n Anyway with it out the way welcome to life warrior guild were you show your progress and work for the team as long as you can cuz it a game we here to have somewhat fun! \n\nGo warriors! Live life!",
